{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29011","headline":"姑苏怀古 · 许浑","name":"姑苏怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宫馆余基辍棹过，黍苗无限独悲歌。\n荒台麋鹿争新草，空苑凫鷖占浅莎。\n吴岫雨来虚槛冷，楚江风急远帆多。\n可怜国破忠臣死，日日东流生白波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}